sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant FE as 前端浏览器
    participant API as rustcloud-api
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant R as Redis
    participant WC as Web Crypto API

    U->>FE: 输入邮箱与口令
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login<br/>email, password
    API->>DB: 按 email 查询用户
    DB-->>API: password_hash, salt, public_key, encrypted_private_key, nonce
    API->>API: Argon2id 验证口令
    API->>R: 记录 access/refresh token 会话
    API-->>FE: JWT, salt, public_key, encrypted_private_key, nonce
    FE->>WC: PBKDF2(password, salt) 重新派生 KEK
    FE->>WC: AES-GCM 解密 encrypted_private_key
    WC-->>FE: RSA 私钥明文 CryptoKey
    FE->>FE: 进入已登录状态，后续解密在浏览器端完成

